## 7. Layout Structure

**Root Layout** (`+layout.svelte`):
```svelte
<script>
  onMount(async () => {
    // 1. Detect mode (daemon or static)
    await initMode();
    
    // 2. In static mode: skip projects + WebSocket
    if (isStaticMode()) return;
    
    // 3. In daemon mode: load projects + connect WebSocket
    await loadProjects();
    const projectPath = getSelectedProjectPath();
    initConnection({ projectPath });
  });
</script>

<SidebarProvider>
  <Sidebar />          <!-- Hidden on mobile with md:block -->
  <SidebarInset>
    <ReadOnlyBanner /> <!-- Only in static mode -->
    <main>
      {#if ready}
        {@render children()}
      {/if}
    </main>
  </SidebarInset>
  <MobileNav />        <!-- Hidden on desktop -->
</SidebarProvider>
```

**Routes**:
- `/` - Dashboard with task counts by status (clickable)
- `/tasks` - Full task list with filters + inline detail panel
- `/items` - Spec items list
- `/inbox` - Inbox with add form
- `/observations` - Observations with filtering

